-- title:
--   dim_ℂ of the Hecke algebra span equals dim S₂(Γ₀(N))
-- statement:
--   Let $N$ be a natural number, assumed nonzero, and consider the complex vector space $S_2(\Gamma_0(N))$ of weight-two cusp forms for the congruence subgroup $\Gamma_0(N)$, written `CuspForm (CongruenceSubgroup.Gamma0 N) 2`. Inside the endomorphism algebra $\operatorname{End}_{\mathbb C} S_2(\Gamma_0(N))$, the set [`CuspForm.heckeGenerators N 2 ∅`](def/CuspForm_HeckeAlgebra.html#L14) consists of the operators [`CuspForm.heckeTLin 2 hℓ hℓN`](def/ModularForm_HeckeOperatorForms.html#L69) for primes $\ell$ not dividing $N$ together with the operators [`CuspForm.heckeULin 2 hqN`](def/ModularForm_HeckeOperatorForms.html#L83) for primes $q$ dividing $N$ (the excluded-prime parameter being the empty set, so no prime is omitted), and [`CuspForm.heckeAlgebra N 2 ∅`](def/CuspForm_HeckeAlgebra.html#L18) is the $\mathbb Z$-subalgebra of $\operatorname{End}_{\mathbb C} S_2(\Gamma_0(N))$ generated by that set, i.e. `Algebra.adjoin ℤ` of it. The assertion is that the $\mathbb C$-linear span, taken inside $\operatorname{End}_{\mathbb C} S_2(\Gamma_0(N))$, of the underlying set of this subalgebra has the same $\mathbb C$-dimension (`Module.finrank`) as $S_2(\Gamma_0(N))$ itself.
--
--   This is the rank equality underlying the perfect $a_1$-pairing between the Hecke algebra and weight-two cusp forms: the complexified full Hecke algebra $\mathbb T\otimes\mathbb C$ and $S_2(\Gamma_0(N))$ are dual, hence of equal dimension. It is used in the construction of an integral structure on $S_2(\Gamma_0(N))$ and in the Hecke-equivariant comparison of $S_2(\Gamma_0(N))$ with the rational Tate module and the period lattice of the modular curve.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_CuspForm_finrank_span_heckeAlgebra_eq_finrank.lean

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_CuspForm_HeckeAlgebra
import Definitions.Def_FLTPrelim_Modularity

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

theorem CuspForm.finrank_span_heckeAlgebra_eq_finrank (N : ℕ) [NeZero N] :
    Module.finrank ℂ (Submodule.span ℂ (CuspForm.heckeAlgebra N 2 (∅ : Set ℕ) : Set (Module.End ℂ (CuspForm (CongruenceSubgroup.Gamma0 N) 2)))) = Module.finrank ℂ (CuspForm (CongruenceSubgroup.Gamma0 N) 2) := by sorry
